pihak.</p></div></div></div>
<!-- Bottom Community Feedback & Testimonial Ribbon -->
<div class="relative z-10 pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high flex-shrink-0"><img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="Close up portrait of a young Indonesian badminton player smiling confidently with racket bag over shoulder in modern sports venue" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC3SHU1ZWZJ5SzfcG3EfYT53wmIBQTjNdo9jHCiTv6aval67sWVRLHurBuu8e_ROtr2teTTJsRi2LONkLudnjKODOd91sgwGgpNAn1urPxoGFlRXkv9RJvKNLgIFm0jEshU3eTMEjx57nTGIPVKIayTpAfpupoTVrdzPrsANiT_njjLr-nBkkHkALzEkgSCpDI_tRRUvn3bZwDlzkRZPXFa0LOsvy7uSjGAgVm-Zz9bIsBBpNKsYmNi"></div><div><p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface">Rian Pratama</p><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Kapten PB Garuda Jaya (Member VIP)</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span><span class="font-data-mono text-data-mono text-on-surface ml-1 font-bold">4.9/5.0</span></div></div><div class="relative z-10 mt-4 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container/70 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]">contact_support</span><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Kendala login? Customer Care kami siap membantu 24/7.</p></div><a class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 flex-shrink-0" data-path="pusat-bantuan" href="#"><span class="">Hubungi Help Center</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">open_in_new</span></a></div>
</div>
<!-- RIGHT COLUMN: Login Form Panel (Col 5) -->
<div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col h-full">
<div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl flex flex-col h-full justify-between">
<!-- Role Switcher Segmented Control -->

<!-- Section Headings -->
<div class="mb-6">
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface font-extrabold tracking-tight">
              Selamat Datang di locArena
            </h1>
<p class="mt-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary" id="role-subtitle">Masuk ke akun Anda untuk booking lapangan dan kelola pesanan olahraga dengan mudah.</p>
</div>
<!-- Login Form Elements -->
<form class="flex flex-col gap-4" id="loginForm" onsubmit="handleLogin(event)">
<!-- Email / No. HP Input Field -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface flex items-center justify-between" for="identifier">
<span class="">Email atau No. Handphone</span>
<span class="text-primary font-data-mono text-[11px]">Wajib</span>
</label>
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="absolute left-3.5 text-on-surface-variant material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">
                  alternate_email
                </span>
<input class="w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors" id="identifier" name="identifier" placeholder="contoh@email.com atau 0812xxxxxxx" required="" type="text">
</div>
</div>
<!-- Password Input Field with Visibility Toggle -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface" for="password">
                  Kata Sandi
                </label>
<a class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary hover:underline transition-colors" data-path="lupa-sandi" href="#">
                  Lupa Kata Sandi?
                </a>
</div>
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="absolute left-3.5 text-on-surface-variant material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">
                  lock
                </span>
<input class="w-full pl-11 pr-11 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Masukkan kata sandi akun Anda" required="" type="password">
<button aria-label="Tampilkan atau sembunyikan kata sandi" class="absolute right-3.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors flex items-center justify-center p-1 focus:outline-none" id="togglePasswordBtn" onclick="togglePasswordVisibility()" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" id="passwordEyeIcon">visibility</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Remember Me Checkbox -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1">
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer group">
<input class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-primary focus:ring-0 focus:outline-none accent-primary cursor-pointer" id="rememberMe" name="rememberMe" type="checkbox">
<span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-on-surface transition-colors select-none">
                  Ingat Saya di perangkat ini
                </span>
</label>
</div>
<!-- Main CTA Button -->
<button class="w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg bg-primary hover:bg-primary-fixed-dim text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-all duration-200" id="submitButton" type="submit">
<span id="btnText" class="">Masuk Sekarang</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
</button>
</form>
<!-- Alternative Social Login Divider -->
<div class="relative my-6 text-center">
<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center">
<div class="w-full h-px bg-surface-container-highest"></div>
</div>
<span class="relative px-3 bg-surface-container-low font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">
